{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217970/extras/b5b917c55ba82ff81db5be650e27fe08.avif?t=1771549179\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2605A &quot;death game&quot; of the smallest scale!\u2605</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the amnesiac protagonist, trapped in a mysterious house with two other captives. You quickly learn that the only way to escape is to have one of the three of you die. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217970/extras/03bad812d7029d996d1df610fda26b0c.poster.avif?t=1771549179\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217970/extras/03bad812d7029d996d1df610fda26b0c.webm?t=1771549179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217970/extras/03bad812d7029d996d1df610fda26b0c.mp4?t=1771549179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you kill or be killed? Who is the mastermind? Is there no way for all of you to survive? The mystery deepens as you find that no matter who dies, the killing game begins anew... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217970/extras/afd99a578e8d3a4ea73904fe80ca1f7c.avif?t=1771549179\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2605Meet your new friends (or enemies)!\u2605</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217970/extras/62fef0e0af566aaef98beb4e2c73ce9c.avif?t=1771549179\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217970/extras/145afccc259655cd9814e3769d6b0ddd.avif?t=1771549179\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217970/extras/c25a7e7fa2afed218984527db72fea90.avif?t=1771549179\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2605Investigate rooms, talk to pretty girls, and make life-or-death choices!\u2605</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by popular mystery adventure game series such as <i>Ace Attorney</i>, <i>Danganronpa</i>, and <i>Zero Escape</i>, YAKG's gameplay offers a mix of immersive dialogue branches, point-and-click room investigations, and some mystery solving--if you can keep everyone from killing each other! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful, hand-drawn rooms of a mysterious house and uncover its eerie secrets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banter with charming girls with gorgeous anime-style artwork and eccentric personalities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in 20+ original music tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10,000+ dialogue lines that move you through the story at a brisk pace </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of quality of life features suited for visual novel pros, including auto-play, dialogue history, skip features, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless choices to make that can change the fates of the characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pet a dog! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ endings to see and piece together to discover the <strong>ultimate truth</strong>... </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Choice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217970/2568278f2f1fbbb23dd39b96cc0fa1c80925189a.jpg"},{"name":"HELLO my name is...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217970/761e80013ecf11c076d6a0f44eee4991e25a2f2e.jpg"},{"name":"Jun's PAFO Card","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217970/05f26313856ff1b0acf52d65bedcefe6db9cd854.jpg"},{"name":"C:/Users/YourNameHere","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217970/8e9a3ba2500a9e312fd3cb5f39ee14609581296f.jpg"},{"name":"Dining with Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217970/5f401b8da2ab3f5e2ac3e31ff3ee038cadc4aa3e.jpg"},{"name":"Hogging the Bathroom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217970/760f2020434cb04e2a80751c32a75473c14295ca.jpg"},{"name":"Residential Remnants","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217970/1db2d986457d16357ced5a9f118f6f0660535ccb.jpg"},{"name":"Occult Obsession","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217970/eca308aa48f6bef8a1ada7b4ddf9f42c2fa9b4be.jpg"},{"name":"Familial Fragments","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217970/626edd7cc2131074607667434f14ff74d6a0bd30.jpg"},{"name":"Under a Corpse's Gaze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3217970/0644d803c0e9a76053a864a7334aedbcc6843b36.jpg"}],"total":60},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3217970?t=1771549179","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771549179","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217970/a76ef19767cfc3849eaa7430c8b2cc661d36931a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771549179","capsule_imagev5":"https://