 with charming girls with gorgeous anime-style artwork and eccentric personalities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in 20+ original music tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10,000+ dialogue lines that move you through the story at a brisk pace </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of quality of life features suited for visual novel pros, including auto-play, dialogue history, skip features, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless choices to make that can change the fates of the characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pet a dog! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ endings to see and piece together to discover the <strong>ultimate truth</strong>... </p></li></ul>","developers":["Soulseer Studios"],"dlc":[3735940],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217970/header.jpg?t=1771549179","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Version: 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible (Apple silicon supported through Rosetta 2)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3217970/796265/9347c026584644538bd6ddb28d28321bc0100ed8/1750881956/dash_av1.mpd?t=1733529859","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamsta